## How "Rumble Combat" Initiative works
* 3 rumbles per round
* Each rumble has 3 parts:
    1. Everyone writes down what they're doing for their action
    2. Everyone reveals what they're doing for their action
    3. Everyone resolves their action in initiative order (which is set at the beginning of combat unless they delay)

## How I'm managing it now
* Use basic OBR Initiative Tracker to keep track of initiative
* Use Rumble Chat to do the "write down and reveal" part, where we each write it down and then everyone hits enter at around the same time
* Resolve from there
* Try to keep track of turns/rumbles manually, sometimes incorrectly

